{"id": "c938515e-f6c5-4750-a9ae-f962cbc6237b", "slug": "cognitive-processing-hub", "title": "Cognitive Processing Hub", "description": "Cognitive Processing Onboarding Section is designed for building reusable UI components in modern web projects. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.", "content": "---\nversion: \"neuform-top-creators-featured\"\nname: \"Cognitive Processing Hub\"\ndescription: \"Cognitive Processing Onboarding Section is designed for building reusable UI components in modern web projects. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.\"\ncolors:\n  primary: \"#6366F1\"\n  secondary: \"#050505\"\n  accent: \"#4F46E5\"\n  background: \"#050505\"\n  surface: \"#161616\"\n  text-primary: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  text-secondary: \"#A1A1AA\"\n  border: \"#262626\"\ntypography:\n  display-lg:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"64px\"\n    fontWeight: 500\n    lineHeight: \"1.04\"\n    letterSpacing: \"0\"\n  body-md:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"16px\"\n    fontWeight: 400\n    lineHeight: \"1.6\"\n  label-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"12px\"\n    fontWeight: 600\n    lineHeight: \"1.2\"\nspacing:\n  base: \"8px\"\n  gap: \"16px\"\n  card-padding: \"24px\"\n  section-padding: \"80px\"\nrounded:\n  card: \"32px\"\n  control: \"48px\"\n  pill: \"9999px\"\ncomponents:\n  card:\n    background: \"Use the surface token with subtle borders and HTML-matched shadow depth\"\n    radius: \"Match the declared card radius token\"\n  button:\n    background: \"Use primary or accent colors for the main action\"\n    radius: \"Use the control or pill radius based on the source HTML\"\n---\n# Cognitive Processing Hub\nSource: Neuform Featured templates from top creators. Author: Sourasith Phomhome (@madebysourasith). Views: 18; favorites: 6; remixes: 0.\nTags: onboarding, animated, webgl, threejs, bento, dither, charts, security.\n## Overview\nCognitive Processing Onboarding Section is designed for building reusable UI components in modern web projects. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.\n\nNarrative Synthesis Core Aggregates behavioral data, cultural trends, and brand taxonomy to construct optimized messaging frameworks for diverse channels. Access Neural Node Establish secure link... Historical queries A…\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nKey visible headings include: Narrative Synthesis Core; Historical queries; Chronological Mapping; Real-time Telemetry; Topological Indexing; Knowledge Graph.\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #6366F1, secondary #050505, accent #4F46E5, background #050505, surface #161616, text-primary #FFFFFF. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse Inter for display moments and Inter for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use JetBrains Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nDashboard, chart, and data panels should preserve their compact operational hierarchy, nested surfaces, and metric emphasis.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Cognitive Processing Hub</title>\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/gsap.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/ScrollTrigger.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/three.js/r128/three.min.js\"></script>\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" crossorigin>\n    <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n</head>\n<body class=\"bg-[#050505] text-white min-h-screen relative overflow-x-hidden flex items-center justify-center p-4 sm:p-8 antialiased selection:bg-indigo-500/30 selection:text-indigo-200\" style=\"font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;\">\n\n    <!-- WebGL Shader Background -->\n    <div id=\"webgl-shader\" class=\"fixed top-0 left-0 w-full h-full pointer-events-none z-0\"></div>\n\n    <!-- Main Wrapper with Container Lines -->\n    <div class=\"w-full max-w-[1200px] mx-auto relative z-10 mt-8 mb-8 sm:mt-12 sm:mb-12\">\n\n        <!-- Vertical Container-Size Lines & Mini Corner Squares -->\n        <div class=\"absolute inset-y-0 -left-4 sm:-left-8 w-px bg-gradient-to-b from-transparent via-white/[0.08] to-transparent pointer-events-none hidden md:block\"></div>\n        <div class=\"absolute inset-y-0 -right-4 sm:-right-8 w-px bg-gradient-to-b from-transparent via-white/[0.08] to-transparent pointer-events-none hidden md:block\"></div>\n\n        <div class=\"absolute top-0 -left-[34px] w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-[#050505] border border-white/[0.2] hidden md:block\"></div>\n        <div class=\"absolute top-0 -right-[34px] w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-[#050505] border border-white/[0.2] hidden md:block\"></div>\n        <div class=\"absolute bottom-0 -left-[34px] w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-[#050505] border border-white/[0.2] hidden md:block\"></div>\n        <div class=\"absolute bottom-0 -right-[34px] w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-[#050505] border border-white/[0.2] hidden md:block\"></div>\n\n        <!-- Premium Gradient Border Wrapper -->\n        <div class=\"rounded-[32px] sm:rounded-[48px] p-[1px] bg-gradient-to-br from-white/[0.12] via-white/[0.03] to-white/[0.05] shadow-2xl\">\n            <!-- Main Dashboard Container -->\n            <main class=\"w-full h-full bg-[#0f0f0f] rounded-[31px] sm:rounded-[47px] p-2 sm:p-4 md:p-6 overflow-hidden relative\">\n\n                <!-- Inner Subtle Ring -->\n                <div class=\"absolute inset-0 rounded-[31px] sm:rounded-[47px] border border-white/[0.02] pointer-events-none\"></div>\n\n                <!-- Bento Grid -->\n                <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-12 gap-4 md:gap-6 relative\">\n\n                    <!-- Card 1: Narrative Synthesis Core (Top Left) -->\n                    <div class=\"md:col-span-7 relative rounded-[28px] p-[1px] bg-gradient-to-br from-white/[0.12] via-transparent to-white/[0.04] group\">\n                        <div class=\"absolute inset-0 rounded-[28px] bg-gradient-to-br from-white/[0.04] to-transparent opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-500 group-hover:opacity-100\"></div>\n                        <div class=\"bg-gradient-to-br from-[#161616] to-[#111111] relative h-full w-full rounded-[27px] p-6 sm:p-8 flex flex-col\">\n\n                            <h2 class=\"text-xl sm:text-2xl tracking-tight font-normal text-white mb-3 masked-reveal\">Narrative Synthesis Core</h2>\n                            <p class=\"text-sm text-neutral-400 leading-relaxed max-w-xl\">\n                                Aggregates behavioral data, cultural trends, and brand taxonomy to construct optimized messaging frameworks for diverse channels.\n                            </p>\n\n                            <!-- Inner Mockup: Search Area -->\n                            <div class=\"mt-8 rounded-2xl bg-[#1a1a1a] border border-white/[0.03] flex-grow flex flex-col overflow-hidden relative\">\n                                <!-- Top Input Section -->\n                                <div class=\"p-5 border-b border-white/[0.03]\">\n                                    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3 text-neutral-300 font-normal text-sm\">\n                                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:stars-linear\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" class=\"text-neutral-400\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n                                        Access Neural Node\n                                    </div>\n                                    <div class=\"bg-[#121212] border border-white/[0.05] rounded-xl px-4 py-3 flex items-center shadow-inner\">\n                                        <span class=\"text-neutral-500 text-sm\">Establish secure link...</span>\n                                    </div>\n                                </div>\n\n                                <!-- Recent Searches Section -->\n                                <div class=\"p-5 flex-grow relative\" style=\"-webkit-mask-image: linear-gradient(to bottom, black 50%, transparent); mask-image: linear-gradient(to bottom, black 50%, transparent);\">\n                                    <h3 class=\"text-xs text-neutral-500 mb-4 tracking-wide uppercase\">Historical queries</h3>\n                                    <div class=\"space-y-4\">\n                                        <div class=\"flex items-start gap-3 bg-gradient-to-r from-white/[0.03] to-transparent p-3 rounded-lg border border-white/[0.02]\">\n                                            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:magnifer-linear\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" class=\"text-neutral-500 mt-0.5 shrink-0\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n                                            <p class=\"text-sm text-neutral-300\">Adjust semantic weighting for technical cohorts.</p>\n                                        </div>\n                                        <div class=\"flex items-start gap-3 p-3 opacity-40\">\n                                            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:magnifer-linear\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" class=\"text-neutral-500 mt-0.5 shrink-0\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n                                            <p class=\"text-sm text-neutral-500\">Analyze readability index for current draft.</p>\n                                        </div>\n                                    </div>\n                                    <div class=\"absolute bottom-0 left-0 w-full h-12 bg-gradient-to-t from-[#1a1a1a] to-transparent pointer-events-none\"></div>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Card 2: Chronological Mapping (Top Right) -->\n                    <div class=\"md:col-span-5 relative rounded-[28px] p-[1px] bg-gradient-to-br from-white/[0.12] via-transparent to-white/[0.04] group\">\n                         <div class=\"absolute inset-0 rounded-[28px] bg-gradient-to-br from-white/[0.04] to-transparent opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-500 group-hover:opacity-100\"></div>\n                        <div class=\"bg-gradient-to-br from-[#161616] to-[#111111] relative h-full w-full rounded-[27px] p-6 sm:p-8 flex flex-col\">\n\n                            <h2 class=\"text-xl sm:text-2xl tracking-tight font-normal text-white mb-3 masked-reveal\">Chronological Mapping</h2>\n                            <p class=\"text-sm text-neutral-400 leading-relaxed mb-8\">\n                                Predictive modeling establishes the ideal broadcast cadence across platforms to ensure maximum visibility and conversion rates.\n                            </p>\n\n                            <!-- Calendar Mockup -->\n                            <div class=\"mt-auto rounded-[20px] bg-[#1a1a1a] border border-white/[0.03] p-5 pb-6\">\n                                <!-- Header -->\n                                <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-6 px-2\">\n                                    <button class=\"text-neutral-400 hover:text-white transition-colors\">\n                                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:alt-arrow-left-linear\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n                                    </button>\n                                    <span class=\"text-sm font-normal text-white tracking-wide\">Sprint Cycle</span>\n                                    <button class=\"text-neutral-400 hover:text-white transition-colors\">\n                                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:alt-arrow-right-linear\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n                                    </button>\n                                </div>\n\n                                <!-- Grid -->\n                                <div class=\"grid grid-cols-7 gap-y-4 gap-x-1 text-center font-normal\">\n                                    <div class=\"text-xs text-neutral-500 mb-2\">Sun</div>\n                                    <div class=\"text-xs text-neutral-500 mb-2\">Mon</div>\n                                    <div class=\"text-xs text-neutral-500 mb-2\">Tue</div>\n                                    <div class=\"text-xs text-neutral-500 mb-2\">Wed</div>\n                                    <div class=\"text-xs text-neutral-500 mb-2\">Thu</div>\n                                    <div class=\"text-xs text-neutral-500 mb-2\">Fri</div>\n                                    <div class=\"text-xs text-neutral-500 mb-2\">Sat</div>\n\n                                    <div class=\"text-sm text-neutral-600\">26</div>\n                                    <div class=\"text-sm text-neutral-600\">27</div>\n                                    <div class=\"text-sm text-neutral-600\">28</div>\n                                    <div class=\"flex justify-center\"><div class=\"w-7 h-7 rounded-full bg-[#6366f1] text-white flex items-center justify-center text-sm shadow-[0_0_12px_rgba(99,102,241,0.4)]\">1</div></div>\n                                    <div class=\"text-sm text-neutral-300\">2</div>\n                                    <div class=\"text-sm text-neutral-300\">3</div>\n                                    <div class=\"text-sm text-neutral-300\">4</div>\n\n                                    <div class=\"text-sm text-neutral-300\">5</div>\n                                    <div class=\"text-sm text-neutral-300\">6</div>\n                                    <div class=\"text-sm text-neutral-300\">7</div>\n                                    <div class=\"text-sm text-neutral-300\">8</div>\n                                    <div class=\"text-sm text-neutral-300\">9</div>\n                                    <div class=\"text-sm text-neutral-300\">10</div>\n                                    <div class=\"text-sm text-neutral-300\">11</div>\n\n                                    <div class=\"text-sm text-neutral-500/50\">12</div>\n                                    <div class=\"text-sm text-neutral-500/50\">13</div>\n                                    <div class=\"text-sm text-neutral-500/50\">14</div>\n                                    <div class=\"text-sm text-neutral-500/50\">15</div>\n                                    <div class=\"text-sm text-neutral-500/50\">16</div>\n                                    <div class=\"text-sm text-neutral-500/50\">17</div>\n                                    <div class=\"text-sm text-neutral-500/50\">18</div>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Card 3: Real-time Telemetry (Bottom Left) -->\n                    <div class=\"md:col-span-4 relative rounded-[28px] p-[1px] bg-gradient-to-br from-white/[0.12] via-transparent to-white/[0.04] group\">\n                         <div class=\"absolute inset-0 rounded-[28px] bg-gradient-to-br from-white/[0.04] to-transparent opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-500 group-hover:opacity-100\"></div>\n                        <div class=\"bg-gradient-to-br from-[#161616] to-[#111111] relative h-full w-full rounded-[27px] p-6 sm:p-8 flex flex-col justify-between overflow-hidden\">\n\n                            <div>\n                                <h2 class=\"text-xl sm:text-2xl tracking-tight font-normal text-white mb-3 masked-reveal\">Real-time Telemetry</h2>\n                                <p class=\"text-sm text-neutral-400 leading-relaxed\">\n                                    Tracks user interaction patterns, scroll depth, and immediate response triggers to facilitate rapid strategy pivots.\n                                </p>\n                            </div>\n\n                            <!-- Gauge Chart -->\n                            <div class=\"relative w-full aspect-[2/1] mt-10 mb-4 flex items-end justify-center\">\n                                <svg viewBox=\"0 0 100 50\" class=\"absolute bottom-0 w-[90%] h-auto\" overflow=\"visible\" style=\"filter: drop-shadow(0 0 20px rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.4));\">\n                                    <defs>\n                                        <linearGradient id=\"gaugeGradient\" x1=\"0%\" y1=\"0%\" x2=\"100%\" y2=\"0%\">\n                                            <stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#4f46e5\" />\n                                            <stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#312e81\" />\n                                        </linearGradient>\n                                    </defs>\n                                    <path d=\"M 5 50 A 45 45 0 0 1 95 50\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#262626\" stroke-width=\"10\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" />\n                                    <path d=\"M 5 50 A 45 45 0 0 1 95 50\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"url(#gaugeGradient)\" stroke-width=\"10\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-dasharray=\"141.3\" stroke-dashoffset=\"141.3\" class=\"gauge-path\" />\n                                </svg>\n\n                                <div class=\"absolute bottom-1 flex flex-col items-center\">\n                                    <span class=\"text-3xl sm:text-4xl tracking-tight font-normal text-white\">94%</span>\n                                    <span class=\"text-xs text-neutral-300 mt-1 uppercase tracking-wider\">Resonance</span>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Card 4: Topological Indexing (Bottom Right) -->\n                    <div class=\"md:col-span-8 relative rounded-[28px] p-[1px] bg-gradient-to-br from-white/[0.12] via-transparent to-white/[0.04] group overflow-hidden\">\n                         <div class=\"absolute inset-0 rounded-[28px] bg-gradient-to-br from-white/[0.04] to-transparent opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-500 group-hover:opacity-100\"></div>\n                        <div class=\"bg-gradient-to-br from-[#161616] to-[#111111] relative h-full w-full rounded-[27px] p-6 sm:p-8 flex flex-col\">\n\n                            <div class=\"mb-10\">\n                                <h2 class=\"text-xl sm:text-2xl tracking-tight font-normal text-white mb-3 masked-reveal\">Topological Indexing</h2>\n                                <p class=\"text-sm text-neutral-400 leading-relaxed max-w-xl\">\n                                    Automatically audits structural formatting, evaluates inbound credibility, and measures domain authority against primary competitors.\n                                </p>\n                            </div>\n\n                            <!-- Inner Graphic Overlay -->\n                            <div class=\"mt-auto bg-[#1a1a1a] rounded-t-[32px] border-t border-x border-white/[0.04] p-8 pb-0 flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-8 relative translate-y-6\">\n\n                                <div class=\"flex-1 pb-12\">\n                                    <div class=\"w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-[#6366f1] to-[#4338ca] flex items-center justify-center shadow-lg shadow-indigo-900/50 mb-6\">\n                                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:chart-square-linear\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" class=\"text-white\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n                                    </div>\n                                    <h3 class=\"text-3xl tracking-tight font-normal text-white mb-3\">Knowledge Graph</h3>\n                                    <p class=\"text-sm text-neutral-500 max-w-xs\">\n                                        Constructs relational maps based on emerging search intent and competitor oversights.\n                                    </p>\n                                </div>\n\n                                <div class=\"flex-1 flex flex-col justify-end gap-3 pb-8 pl-4 border-l border-white/[0.03]\">\n                                    <div class=\"bg-[#141414] border border-white/[0.05] rounded-xl px-4 py-3 w-full shadow-inner relative overflow-hidden\">\n                                        <div class=\"absolute left-0 top-0 h-full w-1 bg-[#6366f1] rounded-l-xl opacity-50\"></div>\n                                        <span class=\"text-xs text-neutral-500\">Isolate primary cluster</span>\n                                    </div>\n                                    <div class=\"bg-[#141414]/50 border border-white/[0.02] rounded-xl px-4 py-3 w-3/4 opacity-50\"></div>\n                                    <div class=\"bg-[#141414]/50 border border-white/[0.02] rounded-xl px-4 py-3 w-1/2 opacity-50\"></div>\n                                </div>\n\n                                <div class=\"absolute bottom-0 left-0 w-full h-24 bg-gradient-to-t from-[#161616] to-transparent pointer-events-none\"></div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                </div>\n            </main>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <script>\n        // Setup GSAP ScrollTrigger\n        gsap.registerPlugin(ScrollTrigger);\n\n        // Masked Reveal Animation for Titles\n        document.querySelectorAll('.masked-reveal').forEach(title => {\n            const text = title.textContent.trim();\n            title.innerHTML = '';\n\n            const words = text.split(/\\s+/);\n            words.forEach(word => {\n                const wrapper = document.createElement('span');\n                wrapper.className = 'inline-flex overflow-hidden pb-1 align-bottom';\n\n                const inner = document.createElement('span');\n                inner.className = 'inline-block translate-y-[110%] will-change-transform';\n                inner.textContent = word;\n\n                wrapper.appendChild(inner);\n                title.appendChild(wrapper);\n                title.appendChild(document.createTextNode(' '));\n            });\n\n            gsap.to(title.querySelectorAll('span > span'), {\n                y: \"0%\",\n                duration: 0.7,\n                ease: \"power3.out\",\n                stagger: 0.04,\n                scrollTrigger: {\n                    trigger: title,\n                    start: \"top 90%\",\n                    toggleActions: \"play none none reverse\"\n                }\n            });\n        });\n\n        // Gauge Animation using GSAP (replaces CSS keyframes)\n        gsap.to('.gauge-path', {\n            strokeDashoffset: 19.7,\n            duration: 1.5,\n            ease: \"power3.out\",\n            delay: 0.3,\n            scrollTrigger: {\n                trigger: '.gauge-path',\n                start: \"top 90%\",\n                toggleActions: \"play none none reverse\"\n            }\n        });\n\n        // WebGL Procedural Dither Background Setup\n        const initWebGLDither = () => {\n            const container = document.getElementById('webgl-shader');\n            if(!container) return;\n\n            const scene = new THREE.Scene();\n            // Use Orthographic Camera for full-screen 2D shader\n            const camera = new THREE.OrthographicCamera(-1, 1, 1, -1, 0, 1);\n\n            const renderer = new THREE.WebGLRenderer({ alpha: true, antialias: false });\n            renderer.setSize(window.innerWidth, window.innerHeight);\n            renderer.setPixelRatio(window.devicePixelRatio);\n            container.appendChild(renderer.domElement);\n\n            const vertexShader = `\n                void main() {\n                    gl_Position = vec4(position, 1.0);\n                }\n            `;\n\n            const fragmentShader = `\n                uniform float time;\n                uniform vec2 resolution;\n\n                // Compact hash & value noise for organic drift\n                float hash(vec2 p) {\n                    p = fract(p * vec2(234.34, 435.345));\n                    p += dot(p, p + 34.23);\n                    return fract(p.x * p.y);\n                }\n                float noise(vec2 p) {\n                    vec2 i = floor(p);\n                    vec2 f = fract(p);\n                    vec2 u = f * f * (3.0 - 2.0 * f);\n                    return mix(mix(hash(i + vec2(0.0,0.0)), hash(i + vec2(1.0,0.0)), u.x),\n                               mix(hash(i + vec2(0.0,1.0)), hash(i + vec2(1.0,1.0)), u.x), u.y);\n                }\n                float fbm(vec2 p) {\n                    float f = 0.0;\n                    float amp = 0.5;\n                    for(int i=0; i<4; i++) {\n                        f += amp * noise(p);\n                        p *= 2.0;\n                        amp *= 0.5;\n                    }\n                    return f;\n                }\n\n                // 4x4 Bayer Matrix Implementation\n                float getBayer(vec2 p) {\n                    int x = int(mod(p.x, 4.0));\n                    int y = int(mod(p.y, 4.0));\n                    if(y==0) {\n                        if(x==0) return 0.0/16.0; if(x==1) return 8.0/16.0; if(x==2) return 2.0/16.0; return 10.0/16.0;\n                    } else if(y==1) {\n                        if(x==0) return 12.0/16.0; if(x==1) return 4.0/16.0; if(x==2) return 14.0/16.0; return 6.0/16.0;\n                    } else if(y==2) {\n                        if(x==0) return 3.0/16.0; if(x==1) return 11.0/16.0; if(x==2) return 1.0/16.0; return 9.0/16.0;\n                    } else {\n                        if(x==0) return 15.0/16.0; if(x==1) return 7.0/16.0; if(x==2) return 13.0/16.0; return 5.0/16.0;\n                    }\n                }\n\n                void main() {\n                    // Pixelate space\n                    float pixelSize = 8.0;\n                    vec2 p = floor(gl_FragCoord.xy / pixelSize);\n\n                    // Normalized coords for vignette and noise\n                    vec2 uv = gl_FragCoord.xy / resolution.xy;\n\n                    // Aspect ratio corrected center for circular vignette\n                    vec2 center = uv - 0.5;\n                    center.x *= resolution.x / resolution.y;\n                    float dist = length(center);\n                    float vignette = smoothstep(0.9, 0.1, dist);\n\n                    // Generate slow organic noise\n                    float n = fbm(p * pixelSize / resolution.y * 1.8 + vec2(time * 0.04, time * 0.03));\n                    n *= vignette; // Fade edges to black\n\n                    // Apply Bayer Dither\n                    float threshold = getBayer(p);\n\n                    // Palette: Near-black to soft gray\n                    vec3 colBase = vec3(0.02, 0.02, 0.02);\n                    vec3 colMid = vec3(0.12, 0.12, 0.12);\n                    vec3 colHigh = vec3(0.25, 0.25, 0.25);\n                    vec3 colHighlight = vec3(0.6, 0.6, 0.6);\n\n                    vec3 finalCol;\n                    // Offset noise heavily by dither matrix\n                    float level = n + (threshold - 0.5) * 0.45;\n\n                    if (level > 0.65) {\n                        finalCol = colHighlight;\n                    } else if (level > 0.4) {\n                        finalCol = colHigh;\n                    } else if (level > 0.18) {\n                        finalCol = colMid;\n                    } else {\n                        finalCol = colBase;\n                    }\n\n                    gl_FragColor = vec4(finalCol, 1.0);\n                }\n            `;\n\n            const uniforms = {\n                time: { value: 0.0 },\n                resolution: { value: new THREE.Vector2(window.innerWidth, window.innerHeight) }\n            };\n\n            const material = new THREE.ShaderMaterial({\n                vertexShader,\n                fragmentShader,\n                uniforms,\n                depthWrite: false,\n                depthTest: false\n            });\n\n            const geometry = new THREE.PlaneGeometry(2, 2);\n            const mesh = new THREE.Mesh(geometry, material);\n            scene.add(mesh);\n\n            const clock = new THREE.Clock();\n\n            const animate = () => {\n                requestAnimationFrame(animate);\n                uniforms.time.value = clock.getElapsedTime();\n                renderer.render(scene, camera);\n            };\n            animate();\n\n            window.addEventListener('resize', () => {\n                const w = window.innerWidth;\n                const h = window.innerHeight;\n                renderer.setSize(w, h);\n                uniforms.resolution.value.set(w, h);\n            });\n        };\n\n        window.addEventListener('load', initWebGLDither);\n    </script>\n</body>\n</html>", "preview_file_name": "cognitive-processing-hub.html", "thumbnail_url": "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/design-system-thumbnails/regenerated-2026-05-22-2s/cognitive-processing-hub.jpg", "source_name": "cognitive-processing-hub-DESIGN.md", "views": 95, "forks": 6, "private": false, "featured": true, "created_by": "5bd6211c-bd4c-467c-b442-4312cac4712c", "created_at": "2026-05-01T16:18:09.070118+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-07-01T15:13:55.018376+00:00"}